Cell["\<\
layeredPoints should be an Association; its Values are rendered in reverse \
layer order.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1175791338,ExpressionUUID->"f001c60c-d2b6-1049-ad45-ffa9c74b4e52"],

Cell["\<\
The destination file format is inferred by Export, for example a .gif path.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1236667773,ExpressionUUID->"7c7d984f-1dd7-244f-8b4f-5bd2e4a42646"],

Cell["\<\
Options include \"DisplayDurations\" -> 0.5, \"PointSize\" -> 0.008 and \
Graphics options. Layer colors are chosen randomly.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->930265477,ExpressionUUID->"71dcf0d1-6886-3d48-ad04-51b917a934c6"],

